<title>BELGIUM: EU says vets Walt Disney/News Corp NEWCO venture.</title>
<headline>EU says vets Walt Disney/News Corp NEWCO venture.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Monday that it was starting a preliminary inquiry into a proposed joint venture between ESPN Inc, a subsidiary of The Walt Disney Company, and Star Television Ltd, which belongs to The News Corporation Ltd.</p>
<p>It said that the joint venture, which is to be called NEWCO, would pool all the assets and licences of ESPN's and Star Television's Asian non-standard sports television distribution businesses.</p>
<p>The operation was submitted to the Commission for clearance on October 9 under the European Union's merger rules. The Commission has one month from that date to clear the deal or start an in-depth investigation. -- Brussels newsroom 322 2876841</p>
